              "value": "Inhabit Vessel"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(manipulate)\n\nThe lion touches and melds with its bonded vessel, bringing the statue to life. It can cease Inhabiting its Vessel by spending a single action, which has the concentrate trait. While Inhabiting the Vessel, it loses its fly Speed and gains Immunities healing, nonlethal; Resistances physical 5 (except bludgeoning); Speed 30 feet; and the following Strikes.\n\n- **Melee** 1A jaws +14, Damage 2d6+7 bludgeoning plus Grab\n- **Ranged** 1A stone ball +13 (range increment 30 feet), Damage 2d4+7 bludgeoning"
